   "moduleId": "new-solutions",
   "question": "A company is developing a serverless application that runs in a VPC. The VPC has public and private IPv4 subnets across multiple Availability Zones. The application connects to the internet through multiple public NAT gateways and an internet gateway. The company must integrate the application with a new service from an external provider by using an AWS Lambda function. The external provider accepts requests from only public IPv4 addresses that are on an approved list. The company must provide connectivity details to the external provider before the application can start using the new service. \fWhich solution will give the application the ability to access the new service?",
