   "question": "A company uses Amazon CloudFront to serve a static application from an Amazon S3 bucket origin. A custom domain maps to the CloudFront distribution. The application calls an Amazon API Gateway Regional API endpoint in the ap-northeast-1 Region for backend APIs. The company configures cross-origin resource sharing (CORS) so the application can access the APIs. Tests find that API calls are slower from outside ap- northeast-1, which causes slow performance. The company must improve the performance of the application.  Which solution will meet this requirement?",
