     "text": "Create a new outbound endpoint in Route 53, and attach the endpoint to the VPC. Ensure that the security groups that are attached to the endpoint can access the on-premises DNS server IP address on port 53. Create a new Route 53 Resolver rule that routes on-premises designated traffic to the on-premises DNS server."
