     "text": "Set up an AWS Direct Connect connection between the on-premises data center and the VPC that hosts the Aurora cluster. Specify the on-premises database as the source endpoint in AWS DMS. Specify the Aurora duster as the target endpoint Configure a DMS task with ongoing replication."
