     "text": "In the build account, modify the continuous integration process to perform a lookup of the IAM user credentials from AWS Secrets Manager. In the web account, create a new IAM user. Store the access key and secret access key in Secrets Manager. Attach the PowerUserAccess IAM policy to the IAM user."
