   "question": "A solutions architect has implemented a SAML 2.0 federated identity solution with their company's on-premises identity provider (IdP) to authenticate users' access to the AWS environment.  When the solutions architect tests authentication through the federated identity web portal access to the AWS environment is granted However, when test users attempt to authenticate through the federated identity web portal, they are not able to access the AWS environment.  Which items should the solutions architect check to ensure identity federation is property configured? (Select THREE)",
