   "question": "A company wants to analyze log data using date ranges with a custom application running on AWS. The application generates about 10 GB of data every day, which is expected to grow. A Solutions Architect is tasked with storing the data in Amazon S3 and using Amazon Athena to analyze the data.  Which combination of steps will ensure optimal performance as the data grows? (Choose two.)",
